# kotoproto-os

- Firmware for a Protogen visor. Simulator in the browser is the test bed. ESP32 HAL is stubs; no real hardware yet.
- License is AGPL-3.0 because of Toaster Blaster. Keep LICENSE, NOTICE, AUTHORS. Credit Kotaz and https://github.com/diodeface/ToasterBlaster.
- Answer the user in Russian.
- Config: `firmware/include/koto/config.hpp`. Do not invent GPIO; pins stay -1.
- Angry/Annoyed mouth frown is baked into P3 frames. Never apply a second 180° mouth rotate at runtime.
- HUD set icons: native 16×8 / 8×8 / 32×8 parts in a 42×16 cell, not a cropped 64×32 scale.
- Keep `tools/` and `assets/` — they regenerate faces.
- C++ includes only at file top. No commits unless asked. Ignore `.tools/` and `build/`.
- Full notes: `AGENTS.md`.
